<!--
  Only canonical, deployed, indexable pages belong here.

  Deliberately excluded:
  - #anchor URLs (#about, #services, #contact, #booking-section). Google
    resolves fragments to the same underlying page, so listing them adds
    duplicate noise rather than coverage.
  - /case-studies/* — not copied into dist by the build, so those URLs 404
    in production. Feeding known 404s to a crawler wastes crawl budget.
  - /v1/* — archived previous design, Disallowed in robots.txt as duplicate
    content.
  - blog-post.html — a client-rendered template, not a standalone page.
-->
